# Exact `module version` pairs exempt from the 7-day soak (urgent CVE patches only).
# One per line. Add a dated reason as a trailing comment. See SUPPLY_CHAIN.md §7.
# Example:
#   golang.org/x/crypto v0.0.0  # 2026-06-01 CVE-2026-XXXX active exploit
github.com/getkin/kin-openapi v0.144.0  # 2026-07-25 GHSA-r277-6w6q-xmqw fix; verified checksum-db + proxy==GitHub tag + full-diff scan; user-approved; THIS version only
